	(text_box "The six pins above CCLK..D03 are the ONLY balls master-SPI configuration can use (UG470).  They are \nordinary user I/O once DONE goes high.  SDRAM A4 moved K19 -> D17 to free FCS_B; the ESP reset \nmoved D17 -> B15.  microSD is on its own CLK/CMD/DAT0 so a card cannot fight the configuration bus."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 216.569 128.778 0)
		(size -136.559 6.096)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -0.0001)
			(type default)
			(color 0 0 0 1)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.016 1.016)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "483b9f0f-a010-48fe-921c-90b83009350e")
	)
	(text_box "The six microSD signals below CCLK/flash are the native 4-bit SD bus: CLK CMD DAT0-DAT3. \nAll sit in bank 34 byte group T0 (R2 T1 T2 U1 V2 W2).  DAT1/DAT2 took CHAN1/CHAN0 off the \nprototyping header; DAT3 is the old SPI chip-select renamed, so only two pins were spent."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 205.453 142.748 0)
		(size -122.903 6.096)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -0.0001)
			(type default)
			(color 0 0 0 1)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.016 1.016)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "962fc3a9-da8c-4095-addc-97b94060e3e6")
	)
